<title>ALBANIA: Albania details treasury bills auctions results.</title>
<headline>Albania details treasury bills auctions results.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issues of Albanian Government Treasury Bills auctions were announced by the Bank of Albania on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Auction No.133 of 91-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		   10.10.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE		     14.10.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			 13.01.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			   730,110,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			  34,519,952 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM YIELD		     19.8   pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM YIELD		     21.5   pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD	  19.905 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		  91.26  pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE	    180,000 Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE 21 pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY	     quarterly</p>
<p>Auction No.134 of 182-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			 Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		   10.10.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE		     14.10.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			 14.04.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			  450,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			 44,565,335 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM YIELD			22    pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM YIELD			22.4  pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD	   22.04 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		  100   pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE Leks 50,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE  22.4  pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY	    semi-annually</p>
<p>Auction No.135 of 384-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			 Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		   10.10.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE		     14.10.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			 13.10.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			   630,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			 113,351,309 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM YIELD		     22 pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM YIELD		     22 pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD pct    22 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		  63 pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE	 10,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE 22 pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY		 annually</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
